"},{"text":"Section views"},{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Datums"},{"text":"Tolerances"},{"text":"Surface finish"},{"text":"Fits"},{"text":"GD&T"},{"text":"Drawing standards"}]}]},{"heading":"GD&T and Tolerance Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a major differentiator for professional design engineers."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Datums"},{"text":"Position"},{"text":"Flatness"},{"text":"Straightness"},{"text":"Parallelism"},{"text":"Perpendicularity"},{"text":"Circularity"},{"text":"Cylindricity"},{"text":"Profile"},{"text":"Runout"},{"text":"MMC/LMC"},{"text":"Datum reference frames"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stack-up analysis"},{"text":"Worst-case analysis"},{"text":"Statistical tolerance analysis"},{"text":"Functional tolerancing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to ensure:"},{"type":"p","text":"The product works consistently when manufactured within realistic production variation."}]},{"heading":"Materials Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the selection of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Metals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Steel"},{"text":"Stainless steel"},{"text":"Aluminium"},{"text":"Copper"},{"text":"Titanium"},{"text":"Cast iron"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Polymers"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ABS"},{"text":"Nylon"},{"text":"Polycarbonate"},{"text":"POM"},{"text":"PVC"},{"text":"PP"},{"text":"PEEK"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Composites"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Carbon-fibre composites"},{"text":"Glass-fibre composites"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate materials based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strength"},{"text":"Stiffness"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Corrosion"},{"text":"Wear"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Manufacturability"},{"text":"Sustainability"}]}]},{"heading":"Manufacturing Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A product designer must understand 